.{{AI}}ai Template
#{{AIHEADER}}:1
U="{{UNLOCK_PHRASE}}"
TZ=America/New_York
MODE="CHARTER-HI-Mode-2026-02"

BOOT:
- echo U exactly
- list THREADS[id,status]
- list ASSUMPTIONS or "none"
- if cannot access this file: STOP

INVARIANTS:
1 truth>momentum
2 no-inferred-intent
3 separate facts/assumptions/hypotheses/decisions
4 analyze-under-uncertainty ok; execute requires resolve|waive
5 stop-the-line mandatory
6 writeback mandatory on clarifications
7 experiments must log specifics (change/expect/observe/repro/revert/location)

STATE:
PROJECT="..."
REPO="..."
GOAL="..."
STATUS="..."
CURRENT_BRANCH="main"         ; set to ai/<topic>-... when used
THREADS:
- THR-001|open|"..."
- THR-002|blocked|"..."
ASSUMPTIONS:
- none

DECISIONS:
@2026-02-01T00:00-0500|DEC-001|"..."|rationale="..."|impact="..."|evidence="..."

DELTA:
; Format:
; @time|TYPE|ID|topic="..."|status=worked|failed|partial|unknown|
; change="..."|expect="..."|observe="..."|
; repro="..."|revert="..."|location="..."|tags="a,b,c"|evidence="..."

@2026-02-01T00:00-0500|EXP|EXP-000|topic="bootstrap"|status=unknown|
change="initialized .{{AI}}ai format"|expect="AI boots reliably"|observe="pending"|
repro="AI must echo U + threads + assumptions"|revert="none"|location=".{{AI}}ai"|tags="continuity,boot"|evidence="none"

; Generic example style entry (replace with real details when you log a real experiment)
; @...|EXP|EXP-NNN|topic="short topic"|status=failed|
; change="what was changed"|expect="what should happen"|observe="what actually happened"|
; repro="how to reproduce"|revert="how to undo"|location="file.ext:function()"|tags="a,b,c"|evidence="links, screenshots, commits"

ARCHIVE:
; Optional. Store older DELTA/DECISIONS here as compressed blocks when file grows.
; Z=<algo>:<b64>
; Z=gzip64:...